# Zero-byte lock files the node xhr-sync worker drops per run (one per headless
# launch, e.g. from tests/test-loop.py). Regenerated every time — never artifacts
# worth committing, but without this they pile up in `git status` and eventually
# hide a real untracked file.
.node-xhr-sync-*
